  "description": "Bring cozy woodland charm to your holiday projects with this Christmas × Rustic Nature Seamless Pattern Bundle, featuring 11 unique seamless pattern designs inspired by rustic Christmas scenery, natural woodland elements, winter foliage, pine branches, berries, festive greenery, and cozy seasonal aesthetics.\nPerfect for Christmas wrapping paper, fabric printing, scrapbook backgrounds, stationery, invitations, sublimation projects, digital paper, textile designs, packaging, home décor, and other holiday crafts. Each design is created as a seamless repeat for smooth and continuous pattern application.\nBundle Includes:\n•\t11 unique seamless pattern designs\n•\tSize: 4096 × 4096 px\n•\tResolution: 300 DPI\n•\tFile Format: JPG\n•\tSeamless repeat-ready designs\n•\tHigh-resolution quality\n•\tIdeal for personal and commercial creative projects\nCreate beautiful rustic holiday products with a warm Christmas woodland and nature-inspired aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring cozy woodland charm to your holiday projects with this Christmas × Rustic Nature Seamless Pattern Bundle, featuring 11 unique seamless pattern designs inspired by rustic Christmas scenery, natural woodland elements, winter foliage, pine branches, berries, festive greenery, and cozy seasonal aesthetics.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Christmas wrapping paper, fabric printing, scrapbook backgrounds, stationery, invitations, sublimation projects, digital paper, textile designs, packaging, home décor, and other holiday crafts. Each design is created as a seamless repeat for smooth and continuous pattern application.</p>\n<p>Bundle Includes:<br>\n•\t11 unique seamless pattern designs<br>\n•\tSize: 4096 × 4096 px<br>\n•\tResolution: 300 DPI<br>\n•\tFile Format: JPG<br>\n•\tSeamless repeat-ready designs<br>\n•\tHigh-resolution quality<br>\n•\tIdeal for personal and commercial creative projects</p>\n<p>Create beautiful rustic holiday products with a warm Christmas woodland and nature-inspired aesthetic.</p>",
